source_event: binutils 2.46.0 -> 2.47 port: 24 of 25 patches replayed under GNU patch but patch_ng rejected 0001 because bfd/configure hunk offsets shifted from 18622 to 18641 while the changed text was identical; regenerating all 25 as exact-offset diffs gave 25/25 strict application.
